            "text": "{\"page\":1,\"results\":[{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/3icyRAqgakNcQn6aDVz9libFmBA.jpg\",\"id\":1423191,\"title\":\"Resident Evil\",\"original_title\":\"Resident Evil\",\"overview\":\"Medical courier Bryan unwittingly finds himself fighting for survival as one fateful, horrifying night collapses around him in chaos.\",\"poster_path\":\"/i7UyjfPio0VFHB9rBUZSFyhOoM8.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[27,878,12],\"popularity\":584.55,\"release_date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.346,\"vote_count\":361},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/b9q9VmbXDvJmTziRqkwdEmFdwhr.jpg\",\"id\":1101383,\"title\":\"The End of Oak Street\",\"original_title\":\"The End of Oak Street\",\"overview\":\"After a mysterious cosmic event rips Oak Street from suburbia and transports their neighborhood to someplace unknown, the Platt family soon discovers that their very survival depends on them sticking together as they navigate their now unrecognizable surroundings.\",\"poster_path\":\"/fYXqpgPmHMphSF2W30GbTeJVIa5.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[878,9648,53],\"popularity\":485.8521,\"release_date\":\"2026-08-12\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.0,\"vote_count\":1450},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/qeQJx07rK2xm8SD2sJxFKhE7gs0.jpg\",\"id\":969681,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"original_title\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"overview\":\"Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn't remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.\",\"poster_path\":\"/bjiS5ipwxb9JFy3XRRN4OAilSeX.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[878,28,12],\"popularity\":653.7739,\"release_date\":\"2026-07-29\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.865,\"vote_count\":2848},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/iuylzRSllrGn7YB322kwKoOVMcq.jpg\",\"id\":1368337,\"title\":\"The Odyssey\",\"original_title\":\"The Odyssey\",\"overview\":\"Odysseus, the legendary King of Ithaca, embarks on a long and perilous journey home following the Trojan War. Throughout his voyage, he is forced to confront the whims of gods, mythological monsters, and trials that stretch both his cunning and his humanity to the breaking point.\",\"poster_path\":\"/5rhTDKUhPYvpdQIijFIs5VoWsON.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[12,28,14],\"popularity\":346.9968,\"release_date\":\"2026-07-15\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":8.0,\"vote_count\":3877},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/qjTqY5coNiz6sVtPng40IzltsoN.jpg\",\"id\":1084244,\"title\":\"Toy Story 5\",\"original_title\":\"Toy Story 5\",\"overview\":\"When Bonnie receives a Lilypad tablet as a gift and becomes obsessed, Buzz, Woody, Jessie and the rest of the gang's jobs become exponentially harder when they have to go head to head with the all-new threat to playtime.\",\"poster_path\":\"/sfQtVlIHljToOwYjhe21KPGzZWK.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[16,10751,35,12],\"popularity\":146.8947,\"release_date\":\"2026-06-17\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":8.355,\"vote_count\":2254},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/d1n2ySWSanU34eEsluRjfrjRq52.jpg\",\"id\":1240889,\"title\":\"Teenage Sex and Death at Camp Miasma\",\"original_title\":\"Teenage Sex and Death at Camp Miasma\",\"overview\":\"After years of slapdash sequels, the Camp Miasma franchise is handed over to an enthusiastic young director for resurrection. But when she visits the original’s star, a now-reclusive actress shrouded in mystery, the two women fall into a blood-soaked world of desire, fear, and delirium.\",\"poster_path\":\"/6Q6Zo6GNXMLP600OJSh6MhW21um.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[35,27,10749],\"popularity\":130.0998,\"release_date\":\"2026-08-06\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.4,\"vote_count\":170},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/bicMU6xVD5deVyKP2azpyx7xkmH.jpg\",\"id\":1263337,\"title\":\"Heart of the Beast\",\"original_title\":\"Heart of the Beast\",\"overview\":\"After a harrowing plane crash, Special Forces officer James Belmont and his combat dog, Odin, find themselves stranded deep in the Alaskan wilderness. Together, they are forced into a brutal fight for survival against the elements.\",\"poster_path\":\"/1ApfSA8JTqeha3GTFEY8syV4auq.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[12,53],\"popularity\":71.8911,\"release_date\":\"2026-09-19\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.7,\"vote_count\":24},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/rZfmzpixLKLR3Hg2u0WgC7XLFl8.jpg\",\"id\":1339713,\"title\":\"Obsession\",\"original_title\":\"Obsession\",\"overview\":\"After breaking the mysterious \\\"One Wish Willow\\\" to win his crush's heart, a hopeless romantic finds himself getting exactly what he asked for but soon discovers that some desires come at a dark, sinister price.\",\"poster_path\":\"/bRwnj8WEKBCvmfeUNOukJPwB43K.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[27,53],\"popularity\":123.629,\"release_date\":\"2026-05-13\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":8.193,\"vote_count\":5688},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/c8hvRzN5nijvp1VcSs8nqHly1bK.jpg\",\"id\":1032863,\"title\":\"The Love Hypothesis\",\"original_title\":\"The Love Hypothesis\",\"overview\":\"Olive Smith, a biology PhD candidate, and Dr. Adam Carlsen, a hotshot professor and well-known tyrant, enter into a fake relationship, seeing each of their carefully calculated theories on love get thrown into chaos.\",\"poster_path\":\"/vfZxVHextAGC70zrNhS8lsROqP1.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[10749,35],\"popularity\":42.8824,\"release_date\":\"2026-09-23\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":8.7,\"vote_count\":25},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/2o9FzuBzCqrDTdlHRuEVnGD2d5h.jpg\",\"id\":1465063,\"title\":\"Forgotten Island\",\"original_title\":\"Forgotten Island\",\"overview\":\"While celebrating their last night together, high school graduates and best friends Jo and Raissa stumble upon a mysterious portal that transports them to the fantastical island of Nakali. When they discover that the memories of their entire friendship are the price for returning home, Jo and Raissa must race to find a way to leave the island before they forget each other forever.\",\"poster_path\":\"/myd1K3gefdNAWFsGNRDdMeiK9Qg.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[16,12,14,35,10751],\"popularity\":44.6583,\"release_date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.6,\"vote_count\":12},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/c6BPbkO5Npt1OdwttAxCFo06wtH.jpg\",\"id\":1108427,\"title\":\"Moana\",\"original_title\":\"Moana\",\"overview\":\"Teenage Moana answers the Ocean's call and, for the first time, voyages beyond the reef of her island of Motunui with infamous demigod Maui on an unforgettable journey to restore prosperity to her people.\",\"poster_path\":\"/gaet1xQ2nxrG0V1Ep9T20ZMNEIC.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[10751,14,35,12],\"popularity\":183.5472,\"release_date\":\"2026-07-08\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.418,\"vote_count\":753},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/8giIQcHpxgsPVP6c7aQtHl3txuh.jpg\",\"id\":1607127,\"title\":\"One Last Shot\",\"original_title\":\"One Last Shot\",\"overview\":\"Seasoned Navy SEAL Jake Harris is called back into action when the world is threatened by a former comrade. To track down and prevent the mastermind from extracting the nuclear codes, Harris must lead his team into enemy territory against a brutal barrage of mercenaries, deadly traps, and a reckoning with his own checkered past.\",\"poster_path\":\"/niQ4NBh2jqAf1hDZP5m6ReWFAb7.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[28,53],\"popularity\":90.7214,\"release_date\":\"2026-09-22\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.7,\"vote_count\":17},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/b7PtCwsuMw84REQq15nmQgT9UXN.jpg\",\"id\":1248832,\"title\":\"Digger\",\"original_title\":\"Digger\",\"overview\":\"The most powerful man in the world embarks on a frantic mission to prove he is humanity's savior before the disaster he's unleashed destroys everything.\",\"poster_path\":\"/1ATXKrIPJyKNwnJ6lcG088Sa6zi.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[35],\"popularity\":33.8641,\"release_date\":\"2026-09-30\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":9.0,\"vote_count\":2},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/3qR1ZxuEzDksDGT13mHH2IiEq7G.jpg\",\"id\":1124142,\"title\":\"The Rivals of Amziah King\",\"original_title\":\"The Rivals of Amziah King\",\"overview\":\"Deep within the backwoods of rural Oklahoma, charismatic and musically gifted Amziah King herds a bluegrass-playing band of misfits while overseeing the premier honey-making operation in town. When Amziah’s estranged foster daughter unexpectedly returns, Amziah leaps at the possibility to renew connection and create a family business. But the honey game is ruthless, and Amziah’s rivals threaten to destroy everything he has built.\",\"poster_path\":\"/j2ajSnvBSb0rvDJrlTWTsxsmHWJ.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[53,80,18],\"popularity\":39.8888,\"release_date\":\"2026-08-13\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.821,\"vote_count\":84},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/dqmMWNWfLnExDRpMtIMqI97GQFR.jpg\",\"id\":1083381,\"title\":\"Backrooms\",\"original_title\":\"Backrooms\",\"overview\":\"A strange doorway appears in the basement of a furniture showroom.\",\"poster_path\":\"/rhGx6E3qRNMgj3i5su2oukNHwIQ.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[27,9648,878],\"popularity\":91.0767,\"release_date\":\"2026-05-27\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.031,\"vote_count\":3385},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/nkEhDomjmPHJSA4Tx8pxv0NlKEy.jpg\",\"id\":1641629,\"title\":\"You+Me - Against the World\",\"original_title\":\"Toi+Moi - Seuls contre tous\",\"overview\":\"Alma Lancaster, 18, appears to lead a perfect life within a wealthy family who believes she is studying law. In secret, she pursues her true dream: filmmaking. On campus, she meets Vadim Arcadi, 20, a magnetic and solitary rebel with a troubled past. Forced to collaborate on a student film, they clash, grow closer and fall in love — despite themselves. But someone is watching them, determined to tear them apart and expose secrets that could destroy both Alma and Vadim.\",\"poster_path\":\"/bAbBNVplg7h79sm94OyHeKk8Phz.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"fr\",\"genre_ids\":[10749,18],\"popularity\":94.6606,\"release_date\":\"2026-09-18\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.731,\"vote_count\":39},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/s4v0UX1anfXm0UvloLsTTJ4v222.jpg\",\"id\":1003596,\"title\":\"Avengers: Doomsday\",\"original_title\":\"Avengers: Doomsday\",\"overview\":\"Beloved heroes from three distinct universes are set on a deadly collision course and face an existential threat unlike anything they've ever encountered.\",\"poster_path\":\"/jzPwsojjFStf5lR5Nm07w2hH56G.jpg\",\"media_type\":\"movie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"genre_ids\":[878,28,12],\"popularity\":53.0277,\"release_date\":\"2026-12-16\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":0.0,\"vote_count\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdro