rsh aftermath of the impact, wrestling with physical injury and emotional despair. When a faint voice crackles over his radio, Ethan discovers he's not as alone as he believed.\",\"popularity\":112.8876,\"poster_path\":\"/yzDuAQCY2n6zzOlBkn6JzhLhY3k.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2026-09-15\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.1,\"vote_count\":5},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/7RyHsO4yDXtBv1zUU3mTpHeQ0d5.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[12,878,28],\"id\":299534,\"title\":\"Avengers: Endgame\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Avengers: Endgame\",\"overview\":\"After the devastating events of Avengers: Infinity War, the universe is in ruins due to the efforts of the Mad Titan, Thanos. With the help of remaining allies, the Avengers must assemble once more in order to undo Thanos' actions and restore order to the universe once and for all, no matter what consequences may be in store.\",\"popularity\":112.3927,\"poster_path\":\"/ulzhLuWrPK07P1YkdWQLZnQh1JL.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2019-04-24\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":8.244,\"vote_count\":28742},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/dJTWIecL2vxsCRl5G0lRhPsfrhc.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[28,53],\"id\":1228834,\"title\":\"The Fix\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Fix\",\"overview\":\"Disillusioned by the end of the war in Afghanistan, a group of disgraced, war-torn ex-CIA operatives set out to Tehran to take down a life-changing score.\",\"popularity\":101.2301,\"poster_path\":\"/yopXjun3ICFfJci2ukcEzceZjUs.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.6,\"vote_count\":25},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/zFCWfU2ViMIm38G1W8UsnSpqmWn.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[10749,18],\"id\":1516698,\"title\":\"The Last Sunrise\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Last Sunrise\",\"overview\":\"Ry, a college student with a chronic illness, escapes to Mallorca for the summer with her mother, where she unexpect