27,35,53],\"id\":1393326,\"title\":\"Ghost in the Cell\",\"original_language\":\"id\",\"original_title\":\"Ghost in the Cell\",\"overview\":\"In a notorious prison, an invisible force begins killing inmates brutally, compelling enemy gangs and corrupt guards to work together as they try to survive the mounting bloodshed.\",\"popularity\":87.5694,\"poster_path\":\"/zxcMdx0w5Zmg8yZuuiS7CJ8vOea.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2026-04-16\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.185,\"vote_count\":73},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/vcZ3UUVmFNk90DBSrTBlTKCdbbE.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[35,18,53],\"id\":1130948,\"title\":\"Rosebush Pruning\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Rosebush Pruning\",\"overview\":\"When an American heir living in a luxurious Spanish villa decides to move in with his girlfriend, his departure triggers a family collapse as his brother uncovers the truth behind their mother's tragic death.\",\"popularity\":83.9119,\"poster_path\":\"/rsHEVjzxU8cxz1sm3vboj99daNv.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2026-04-23\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.136,\"vote_count\":55},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/bicMU6xVD5deVyKP2azpyx7xkmH.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[12,53],\"id\":1263337,\"title\":\"Heart of the Beast\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Heart of the Beast\",\"overview\":\"After a harrowing plane crash, Special Forces officer James Belmont and his combat dog, Odin, find themselves stranded deep in the Alaskan wilderness. Together, they are forced into a brutal fight for survival against the elements.\",\"popularity\":71.8911,\"poster_path\":\"/1ApfSA8JTqeha3GTFEY8syV4auq.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2026-09-19\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.909,\"vote_count\":22},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/hrCTKrc3Tz2wbPOt5rcrlAhqF11.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[878,9648,28],\"id\":1058424,\"title\":\"Hope\",\"original_language\":\"ko\",\"original_title\":\"호프\",\"overview\":\"In the remote South Korean village of Hope Harbor, police chief Bum-seok and officer Sung-ae are called to investigate a mysterious creature wreaking havoc on the community. But all is not as it seems, and perceptions can be misleading. What begins as ignorance plants the seed of disaster, escalating through human conflict into a tragedy of cosmic proportions.\",\"popularity\":69.9905,\"poster_path\":\"/1n37BJchWHLiSYQkuFxe5KjB951.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2026-07-15\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.413,\"vote_count\":86},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/yBDxqDB29kpH9VojTytjGWBgmdJ.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[53],\"id\":1101412,\"title\":\"Fall 2: Deadpoint\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Fall 2: Deadpoint\",\"overview\":\"On a perilous climb across Thailand's Mount Kwan, two climbers become trapped thousands of feet above the ground, where vertigo-inducing heights, sheer exposure, and impossible odds turn every moment into a fight for survival.\",\"popularity\":67.2442,\"poster_path\":\"/fgSm5ylwiXbIHn8UbUXDjk9RRu4.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2026-09-01\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.5,\"vote_count\":44},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/lSd6nEnlaeQkswLLUgHC5gyuXyU.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[53,80],\"id\":1514682,\"title\":\"Above & Below\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Above & Below\",\"overview\":\"A group of friends set off for an unforgettable vacation. What begins as an adventure of partying and diving quickly turns into a nightmare when they are attacked by criminals in open waters.\",\"popularity\":64.1657,\"poster_path\":\"/7bOuu1SRALGwsG2fLCTvRkCmQBj.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2026-07-29\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.1,\"vote_count\":39},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/2c9zNZJL0ZdagD6JbmU3hH4hovs.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[28,35,53],\"id\":1377237,\"title\":\"Runner\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Runner\",\"overview\":\"A former soldier is thrown into a brutal race against time when a critical medical delivery makes him and his unlikely partner the targets of a ruthless cartel. As the mission spirals into a deadly manhunt, every detour, delay, and bullet pushes them closer to failure. With betrayal closing in from every side, they must survive the chase and deliver their cargo to save the life of a little girl.\",\"popularity\":60.807,\"poster_path\":\"/yBKMAIj7clP42UkFejhGDBBoTpb.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.7,\"vote_count\":32},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/i0eR9O1FnCgBm1cH8WwqxGbAXMS.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[28,80,53],\"id\":1280738,\"title\":\"The Furious\",\"original_language\":\"zh\",\"original_title\":\"火遮眼\",\"overview\":\"After a criminal network kidnaps Wang Wei's daughter and the corrupt police refuse to assist him, Wei sets out on his own to locate her. Navin, a tenacious journalist whose wife has mysteriously vanished, is his only ally. In this explosive martial arts showdown, the unlikely duo fights the kidnappers ruthlessly driven by a furious vengeance.\",\"popularity\":58.328,\"poster_path\":\"/ivQ1Z3lI1xWvAeGDHBw3CCYZDGJ.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2026-06-10\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":8.2,\"vote_count\":750},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/1ebY06Gc1eUZcCoO7IoD4tWCFxm.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[28,10752],\"id\":1594914,\"title\":\"Lucky Strike\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Lucky Strike\",\"overview\":\"A wounded American soldier fights to survive behind enemy lines during WWII's Battle of the Bulge against the Germans, relying on his instinct, spy craft and a hand-radio to evade capture and find his way back to his unit.\",\"popularity\":57.8436,\"poster_path\":\"/7AEBdyGYXumXWmMFeynE8227KeZ.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2026-06-26\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.8,\"vote_count\":47},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/gQsjbxdjJUam7buy4U2TpVTiGSO.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[35],\"id\":1288059,\"title\":\"I Want Your Sex\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"I Want Your Sex\",\"overview\":\"When a naive young man becomes the sexual muse for a renowned and provocative artist, his dream job quickly turns dangerous as he is drawn into an obsessive world of power, betrayal, and murder.\",\"popularity\":46.8731,\"poster_path\":\"/pR7SIX3AwqdoD96OI44oLG98e7g.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2026-07-29\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.1,\"vote_count\":82},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/2o9FzuBzCqrDTdlHRuEVnGD2d5h.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[16,12,14,35,10751],\"id\":1465063,\"title\":\"Forgotten Island\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Forgotten Island\",\"overview\":\"While celebrating their last night together, high school graduates and best friends Jo and Raissa stumble upon a mysterious portal that transports them to the fantastical island of Nakali. When they discover that the memories of their entire friendship are the price for returning home, Jo and Raissa must race to find a way to leave the island before they forget each other forever.\",\"popularity\":44.6583,\"poster_path\":\"/myd1K3gefdNAWFsGNRDdMeiK9Qg.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.6,\"vote_count\":12},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/1mImp4LczEYMx7c6LZUlUyAilJu.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[12,35,28],\"id\":1284186,\"title\":\"Sacrifice\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Sacrifice\",\"overview\":\"During a star-studded charity gala brimming with celebrities, billionaires and empty speeches, a movie star in the midst of an existential crisis is taken hostage by a radical warrior and her devoted followers. As the night descends into chaos, both an inward journey and an outward adventure ensue, where the line between performance and belief, salvation and sacrifice, begins to blur.\",\"popularity\":43.8716,\"poster_path\":\"/SGH7mlgfDyGgRCi2At62Ljg3zV.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2026-04-09\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.474,\"vote_count\":19},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/qcIKxhqGMIj8uujsSoSMZWr8QqU.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[28,53],\"id\":1122573,\"title\":\"In the Grey\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"In the Grey\",\"overview\":\"A covert team of elite operatives are living in the shadows. When a ruthless despot steals a billion-dollar fortune, they're sent to take it back—an impossible heist that erupts into a deadly game of strategy, deception and survival.\",\"popularity\":41.8381,\"poster_path\":\"/dQgIcW6Th08kMRf2HBoYWoFE6OD.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2026-05-13\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.572,\"vote_count\":1008},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/lV1P1Q5gLDXVG1ZYCxZHStkcQC3.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[878,12,53],\"id\":131631,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games: Mockingjay - Part 1\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Hunger Games: Mockingjay - Part 1\",\"overview\":\"After surviving the Quarter Quell, Katniss finds herself in the hidden stronghold of District 13, where the rebellion against the Capitol is gaining momentum. Struggling with the weight of becoming the symbol of resistance, she must navigate fragile alliances while trying to protect those she loves. As propaganda battles rage and Panem moves closer to full-scale war, Katniss is forced to confront the true cost of revolution.\",\"popularity\":40.0056,\"poster_path\":\"/4FAA18ZIja70d1Tu5hr5cj2q1sB.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2014-11-19\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.814,\"vote_count\":17020}],\"total_pages\":73,\"total_results\":1451}"
